# Formerly rejected:
# fn(x R) R {x} $in fn(y R) R
# Now: checked anonymous function membership uses its declared signature.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_rule/anonymous_function_declared_signature.lit
# Boundary: changed carriers, dropped domain conditions, malformed body and
# changed free identities are rejected in predicate_domain_wd tests.
fn(x R) R {x} $in fn(y R) R
forall F set:
    fn(B F) F {B} $in fn(A F) F
fn(x R: x > 0) R {1 / x} $in fn(y R: y > 0) R
